+// the user-plane config default for user tables, and the validated parent-row
+// policy a managed split or merge carries to its children. Neither is an
+// identity count, and neither is the owning system-table schema declaration -
+// which is exactly why the clause about the owning schema is scoped to the
+// bootstrap sites above rather than asserted over these.
+const DECLARED_POLICY_SOURCE_SITES = Object.freeze([
